# A thousand drones churning on a custody mesh, telemetry every 5 s for a minute. 512 join late (down at 0, up across
# the first 30 s); 300 die across 10 to 40 s and half come back; 200 reboot twice from their boot image, the second
# time reusing nonces; 100 are reflashed at 45 s, a clone at epoch 1 coming up beside its original. Signed, gcs is the
# hub with a window for every believed drone: a reused nonce is Duplicate or Replay there. Unsigned it is a leaf with 16
# windows, and a reused nonce from a drone past them runs. A clone one epoch behind its original reports beside it,
# believed while an honest report of the older epoch could still arrive (600 s), and its answers lose to the original's.
seed 1000
peers 1024
profile dtn
